    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0935" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.043/18</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Czechoslovak Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Skalický</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p>The Czechoslovak Chargé d’Affaires ad interim presents his compliments to His
                    Excellency, the Honorable Secretary of State, and has the honor to request his
                    kind information in the following matter.</p>
                <pb facs="0936" n="822" xml:id="pg822"/>
                <p>The Legation has been asked by the Ministry of Justice at Prague to provide it
                    with a statement of a competent American authority in due form of an
                    interpretative opinion (1) if and eventually to what extent under the laws of
                    the United States of America it is admissible to present a suit against a
                    foreign state, (2) whether it is admissible to enforce a judgment against a
                    foreign state in the territory of the United States of America and if so on what
                    kind of property of the foreign state, and by what method of enforcement or
                    execution of judgment, (3) whether the diplomatic missions or other
                    representative authorities of the United States of America in foreign countries
                    are entitled to represent their own state also before the courts of justice of
                    the recipient state and if they may lawfully receive for it and in its name
                    judicial records and documents of foreign courts.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1930-11-13">November 13,
                            1930</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>#5334</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
